<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for submitting your <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">application</a> to the <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/">College of Health Solutions</a> at Arizona State University. Once your file is complete, our admission committee will review your file and communicate a decision within three weeks.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You may review details about the status of your application in <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/">My ASU</a> and also verify receipt of your supplemental materials such as transcripts and letters of recommendation.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please reply to this email to let me know when we might expect to receive your remaining application materials so I can make a note in your file for the admission committee.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you need more details about the program or the admission process, please do not hesitate to call or email me directly. Thank you again for your application. I look forward to working with you throughout the admission process.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div>{!User.Email}</div><div><br></div><div><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div><br></div></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>